<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.07 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.07 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on Wednesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the rest of the month was 3.07 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Jan 24			2,600</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Jan		6,319</p>
<p> Average reserves to Jan 21			   8,154</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    3,074</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
